    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama akangambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w'omuntu, orange ebiligwera abarangi ba Isiraeli, abaranga nibetumisiliza, oti, ‘Muhulire ekigambo ky'Omukama!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Bagwerwa abarangi abafera abalikufa gakora ekyo batekeleza, okwo bataina kyobaboine! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Isiraeli, abarangi bawe nibashusha emiha y'omu matongo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibalinda boma mbali ekambukire handiki kwombekera ihanga lya Isiraeli eboma, kushobora kukiza Isiraeli egyo aha ndashana kiro ekyo Omukama alibonabonyia eihanga elyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibagamba ebishuba, nibyo balikuragura. Nibagira bati, ‘Omukama niwe alikugamba,’ kandi okwo Omukama atabatumire, nibashuba nibategeleza k'agobesheleza ebyo balikugamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo mulikugira muti, ‘Omukama niwe alikugamba,’ mara okwo inye ntagambire, timulikugamba ebyo mutabonekeirwe n'okuramura ebishuba?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orw'ekyo Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati, “Orwo mulikugamba ebishuba n'ebyo mutabonekeirwe, nikyo ndikubarwanisiza. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyija kubonabonyia abarangi abalikugamba ebyo batabonekeirwe, bakaragura n'ebishuba. Tibaligya mu rukiiko rwa bantu bange, anga kuhandikwa mu kitabo kya ihanga lya Isiraeli, nangu n'omu nsi ya Isiraeli tibalitahamu; aho mwije mumanye okwo Ruhanga Omukama aba inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo, kuba bahabisize abantu bange nibagamba bati, ‘Mirembe,’ okwo emilembe etaliho. Orwo abantu balikwombeka eboma, abarangi aba baija bagisiiga einoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu abo abalikusiga eboma einoni obagambire okwo eboma egyo eligwa! Haligwa enjura y'omutunga, mara egwe n'amabare gahango, n'omuyaga gw'amani gwihye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isi orwo eboma elikumba, tibalibabaza bati, ‘Okusiiga eboma einoni kwabagashaki?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Orwo ndinigara ndisindika omuyaga gw'amani, habeho n'enjura y'omutunga, ey'amabare gahango bisilikye eboma egyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eboma eyo musigire einoni ndigikumbya ngiseleeze aha itaka, esigare ekitebe kyonkai. Orwo elikumba elibagwera ebaite; mwije mumanye okwo Omukama aba inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo ndinigara nkakumbya eboma, nkabonabonyia n'abatura nibakaaba einoni. Kandi ndibagambira inywe nti: Eboma yahwaho n'abagikaaba einoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abarangi ba Isiraeli abarangaga ahali Yerusalemu, nibagamba okwo omu kubonekerwa kwabo nibabona Yerusalemu eina emilembe, kandi okwo emilembe etaliho. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kandi iwe mwana w'omuntu, oraleba Abaisiraeli abalikuranga nibetumisiliza. Orange ebilibagwaho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogambe oti, Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Mulibona inywe bakazi abashona obuhuzi bw'engisha obw'okwekoma aha mikono omu bw'amata, nimushonera abantu ba buli ngeli ebihundwi by'aha mutwe ebiinamu engisha kubatega, nimuhiga obushobora bw'okwita abantu bange anga kubakiza, kyonkai obushobora obwo nimugonza kubwihyamu amagoba aganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumpemwire omu maisho g'abantu bange nimuhiga ebikamato by'eshayiri n'obwakulya butaina mbali buli. Nimwita abantu abatalikuragirwa kufa. Kandi abatalikuragirwa kurora abo nimubaleka. Abantu bange nimubagambira ebishuba mara nibabesiga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati, “Leba, obuhuzi bwanyu bw'engisha obwo mulikutegesa abantu nimbutamwa, ninyija kububagutura aha mikono. Kandi abantu abo mulikutega ninyija kubabataishuza bakagenda okw'obona enyonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ebihundwi byanyu ndabibakaramura aha mitwe, abantu bange mbabaihye omu mikono, timulishuba kubatega rundi kubakwata; aho mwije mumanye okwo Omukama aba inye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimugamba ebishuba kuhenda abarungi emikono, abo inye ntakahendaga mitima. Omubi mwamugumisa omu ntambaraze, atalekera mafuge akarokora burorabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orw'ekyo timulishuba kugamba kwo mubonekeirwe okwo mutabonekeirwe, n'okuragura timukiragura. Kandi abantu bange ndabajuna, mbaihye omu mikono yanyu. Aho mwije mumanye okwo Omukama aba inye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
